      "location": "[F7]",
      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "[F7] states that the elementary symmetric polynomial e_n is sum_{σ∈S_n} x_{σ(1)}⋯x_{σ(n)}. The cited def-elementary-symmetric-polynomials defines e_k as the sum over increasing k-element index sets, so e_n=x_1⋯x_n; the [F7] formula is n! times that. Accordingly, Proof 2.3's stated substitution gives n! T_1⋯T_n under [F7], not T_1⋯T_n. Dividing by n! over C repairs that proof step, but does not make [F7]'s formula correct.",
